{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲说清了珍惜之物仍有分量，因而不愿被失落定义，以及挺立虽能维持姿态、却不能减轻眷恋，反而让他更清楚自己有多在意，导致再次聚力时更急、更难安稳的反馈机制；但它没有具体解释38–43小节的退落如何影响44–65小节的再次聚力，也没有充分展开身体先于明确念头的反应和三连音如何使焦灼加剧。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙把旧歌的亲近却不可重新拥有、身体先承受事情的分量而尚无现成解释、以尊严和克制收拢自己，以及这种应对虽暂时有效却因反复维持而更加暴露在意，连成了具体的因果链，并用两轮聚力的差异解释情绪转折，也保留了自我控制与不甘抵抗作为并列动因；但H1、H2、M等未在文本中交代的标签增加了理解负担，而且第一次高涨后的舒展感、身体先于问题而疲惫等细节，超出了听感记录能够直接确认的范围。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙的优势不只是篇幅更长，而是补出了身体反应、应对策略及其反作用、两轮聚力之间的因果联系，这些正是甲较为概括之处；其局部推断虽有过度具体化的风险，但不足以抵消这些实质性的解释增益。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5502680c-7e32-4b8c-a5f5-195e1de05e15", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133911495585Z", "elapsed_seconds": 117.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:41:08.495201+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "90a23b732fd302e2a9314fdd05642fce232fd481d71628f7235a4676cd403e44", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py"